// Phase signoffs - each phase must be explicitly resolved with the user before
// rendering: :done (reviewed and approved) or :not_applicable (with a note
// saying why, e.g. no UI => surfaces n/a). `just check` ignores these
// (structural tier); `just check-full` and therefore `just render` enforce
// them, so a skipped phase is always a recorded decision, never an accident.
signoff interview { }
signoff research { }
signoff surfaces { }
signoff scenarios { }
signoff data_model { }
signoff prd { }
